{"c":[{"id":"f2c538954be02f23","sum":"niko-core stays when a workflow restates it. Progress Tracking stays out of niko-core; task lists are Niko-workflow only. L4 preflight dispatches on progress.md Complexity Level 4, not milestones.md: sub-runs keep milestones.md and still need the L2/L3 TDD bar.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260903T020823Z-863b2cb139a2db13","text":"niko-core is the omnipresent baseline: do not strip it because a workflow restates the same idea. Progress Tracking stays out of niko-core — task lists are Niko-workflow only.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T163802Z-128a4d11c5b57281","text":"L4 preflight must dispatch on progress.md Complexity Level 4, not milestones.md presence: sub-runs keep milestones.md and still need the L2/L3 TDD bar.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b0930c512db1fec0","sum":"L4 done, risks, and ticket refs live in milestones.md or projectbrief.md: Step 2a deletes tasks.md and progress.md. Preflight and QA are spawnable, one-line bootstrap, not routers. L2 and L3 share one preflight bar; L4 is a sibling reference in niko-preflight.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260912T163805Z-74c7fba4792433f6","text":"L4 per-milestone done, risks, and ticket refs must live in milestones.md or projectbrief.md: /niko Step 2a deletes tasks.md and progress.md before later milestones run.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T164808Z-b70c7feb534b80b1","text":"Preflight and QA stay spawnable skills with a one-line Run the skill bootstrap; they are not plan/build workflow routers. L2 and L3 share one preflight bar; L4 is a sibling reference inside niko-preflight.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
